{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01536",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 3.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.66,
      "end_seconds": 9.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.35,
      "end_seconds": 18.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "hello, uh, doctor i'm here with them in case I can help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.37,
      "end_seconds": 24.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.18,
      "end_seconds": 29.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I've been dealing with morning stiffness for an hour"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.32,
      "end_seconds": 36.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines. Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 38.9,
      "end_seconds": 58.37,
      "duration_seconds": 19.47,
      "text": "she is on furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning for the fluid, I give it to her. It's febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout, doctor. It's warfarin, in the evening for the blood thinning, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.89,
      "end_seconds": 66.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 66.9,
      "end_seconds": 77.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "3 milligrams. She is on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.73,
      "end_seconds": 80.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.17,
      "end_seconds": 84.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "ever since... since this morning, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.88,
      "end_seconds": 88.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Alright, how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.39,
      "end_seconds": 94.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "hmm, I'd give it a seven, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.27,
      "end_seconds": 103.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 103.56,
      "end_seconds": 109.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.61,
      "end_seconds": 126.6,
      "duration_seconds": 14.99,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Uh, as for sore wrists, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.38,
      "end_seconds": 130.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "have you noticed fever or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.86,
      "end_seconds": 142.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "No, no fever, no rash. I did have swollen painful finger joints at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.96,
      "end_seconds": 147.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Have you noticed eye redness or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.16,
      "end_seconds": 153.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "no eye redness or chest pain, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.63,
      "end_seconds": 156.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.8,
      "end_seconds": 158.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.54,
      "end_seconds": 163.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.59,
      "end_seconds": 175.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.22,
      "end_seconds": 181.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.71,
      "end_seconds": 203.09,
      "duration_seconds": 19.38,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.61,
      "end_seconds": 208.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.41,
      "end_seconds": 212.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.43,
      "end_seconds": 227.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "alright, anything in your past medical history I should know? It helps to be thorough at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.33,
      "end_seconds": 236.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "Okay, so I have heart failure. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.67,
      "end_seconds": 238.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "hm, okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.77,
      "duration_seconds": 19.76,
      "text": "hmm, I've had gout, yes. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I've, I've got an irregular heartbeat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.72,
      "end_seconds": 262.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.23,
      "end_seconds": 266.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.05,
      "end_seconds": 272.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.96,
      "end_seconds": 275.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 276.66,
      "end_seconds": 283.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to trimethoprim once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.62,
      "end_seconds": 287.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "really? I don't think so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.6,
      "end_seconds": 291.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Fair enough, I'll write down both versions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.76,
      "end_seconds": 297.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.97,
      "end_seconds": 300.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.9,
      "end_seconds": 320.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "The knuckles and wrists are swollen and warm, and the squeeze test is painful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.65,
      "end_seconds": 328.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "So, thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.74,
      "end_seconds": 358.55,
      "duration_seconds": 15.81,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards an inflammatory arthritis flare. I can't rule out osteoarthritis yet. Let's get X-rays of the hands, for inflammatory arthritis. I want blood tests done, that's for inflammatory arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.85,
      "end_seconds": 361.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.84,
      "end_seconds": 374.54,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "I'm prescribing methotrexate, 10 milligrams, once a week, long term. That should help with inflammatory arthritis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.79,
      "end_seconds": 383.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.67,
      "end_seconds": 396.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "Gentle hand exercises and warm water in the morning. We'll catch up in four weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.61,
      "end_seconds": 401.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Yeah, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.25,
      "end_seconds": 404.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}